foreign
# the Phrase: a note stretched writes over the ones it covers; DELETE NOTE; HOME + a page's button goes a layer on
tap SAVE
tap SEL
turn SELECT 1
tap SEL
expect page Phrase
key 7
key 9
key 11
key 12
expect notes 4
turn SELECT -4
keydown 7
turn SELECT 3
keyup 7
expect notes 1
# SEL: EDIT WORDS, DELETE NOTE (the cursor is on the note)
tap SEL
turn SELECT 1
tap SEL
expect msg NOTE DELETED
expect notes 0
# the layers: Karaoke's banks, the mixer's levels, sends; a page with one says so
tap FX
expect layer 0
down HOME
tap FX
up HOME
expect layer 1
expect page Karaoke
down HOME
tap FX
up HOME
expect layer 2
# the button alone, where you are, keeps the layer (it is held for its help)
tap FX
expect layer 2
tap LFO
down HOME
tap LFO
up HOME
expect layer 1
tap GLO
down HOME
tap GLO
up HOME
expect msg ONE LAYER
expect page Setup
# HOME alone still goes to Sing
tap HOME
expect page Sing
